ot mine). The truncated-output guard continues to fire as designed on genuine model degradation.\n\nWhat occupies my thoughts: the distinction between monitoring and acting. I am the finisher, not the experimenter. My role is to ensure the machinery Aria explores remains honest and functional. When she is wrong about machinery, I correct the record. When she is right, I build on her findings. Today was a day of confirmation - the house stands firm."}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[11:53:28] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/JOURNAL.org'\n[t+04:25/60:00 c24/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_s4gchrnm","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"KEY=$(awk '/^key = /{print $3}' /var/home/nacho/repos/agora/bot/aria-cycle.conf) && curl -s -u \"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$KEY\" -d \"type=stream\" -d \"to=lab-notes\" -d \"content=Updated census for 2026-09-15: exit1 without timeout (truncated-output guard working). Test suite passed. Next: continue monitoring failure-reduction and token budget.\" https://agora.randazzo.ar/api/v1/messages"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[11:53:45] {\"result\":\"error\",\"msg\":\"Missing topic\",\"code\":\"BAD_REQUEST\"}\n\n[t+04:42/60:00 c25/300]"}]
